   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Sad, Sad Song**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Oh Lonesome Me**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Poison Cup**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Rollercoaster**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Duet for Guitars #3**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Chinese Translation**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **One Life Away**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Outta My Head**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Sec Walkin', Librarian, Smokin From Shootin, Thank You Too [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2008-03-15.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 20 songs; 86 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- M Ward performed solo, then joined Jim James for the remainder of the set [1]\n- The concert took place at St. David's Church in Austin during SXSW 2008 [1]\n- The acoustic performance was considered exceptional, unlike a typical My Morning Jacket show [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2008-03-15.aud.flac16**: taped by Josh Finklea; transferred by Josh Finklea; source: Church Audio ST-11 cardiods > Church Audio ST-9000 preamp > iRiver H-120 [1]",
